   "id": "m-muxt1mca-8",
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "Relay’s core is a shared session API, used by both the VS Code and phone interfaces.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    subgraph UI[\"User interfaces\"]\n        Desktop[\"VS Code sidebar / editor tab\"]\n        Phone[\"Phone · same chat UI\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Host[\"VS Code extension host\"]\n        Remote[\"Remote server\"]\n        Panel[\"PanelHost<br/>Commands ↔ state snapshots\"]\n        API[\"RealSessionsApi<br/>Queues · forks · approvals · run limits\"]\n        Scheduler[\"Scheduler\"]\n        Store[\"SessionStore\"]\n        Claude[\"ClaudeAdapter\"]\n        Codex[\"CodexAdapter\"]\n        Browser[\"Browser controller<br/>Element picker · notes · screenshots\"]\n        Hints[\"Model suggestions\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Processes[\"Local processes\"]\n        ClaudeCLI[\"Claude Code CLI\"]\n        CodexCLI[\"Codex app-server\"]\n        MCP[\"Chrome DevTools MCP\"]\n        Chrome[\"Relay Chrome window\"]\n    end\n\n    Files[(\".relay/<br/>Sessions · schedules · screenshots\")]\n    Git[(\"Git worktrees\")]\n    Jev[\"TypeSafe Jev API\"]\n\n    Desktop <-->|postMessage| Panel\n    Phone <-->|Tailscale · POST / SSE| Remote\n    Remote <--> Panel\n    Panel <--> API\n    Panel --> Scheduler\n    Scheduler -->|Create session + send prompt| API\n    Scheduler --> Files\n    API <--> Store\n    Store --> Files\n    API -->|Create / merge| Git\n\n    API <-->|TurnSink events| Claude\n    API <-->|TurnSink events| Codex\n    Claude <-->|Agent SDK| ClaudeCLI\n    Codex <-->|JSON-RPC over stdio| CodexCLI\n\n    API -->|Open browser| Browser\n    Browser <-->|CDP| Chrome\n    Browser -->|Note into composer| Panel\n    Browser --> Files\n    ClaudeCLI --> MCP\n    CodexCLI --> MCP\n    MCP <-->|CDP| Chrome\n\n    Panel --> Hints\n    Hints <-->|Optional difficulty scoring| Jev\n```\n\n[Open the detailed SVG diagram](/Users/bart/orca/workspaces/relay/bart-mermaid-diagrams-in-chat/.pr-lens/overview-dark-ba45a6f4e7a60dfe835a168f929b4d7d.svg).\n\nApprove publishing a shareable PR Lens link?\n\nAutomatic approval review blocked publishing because it would upload repository component names and source file paths to an external service.",
